{"unit_id":"xiaohaozi12138__dsh-desktop-win32#feature-1","repo":"xiaohaozi12138/dsh-desktop-win32","commit":"5d110a05f171cd4fc4acfb2fa4bdb4a5ec2fb544","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-launcher-win32 的功能「桌面快捷启动」：插件加载时在 Windows 桌面写入启动脚本并创建带图标的 .lnk 快捷方式。双击后检测端口，必要时启动 DSH Web，等待就绪后打开配置的 URL。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:101-139","index.js:192-216"]}
